[32m+[m[32m# Portfolio Project Report[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Project Goal[m
[32m+[m[32mCreate a premium personal portfolio website for Kanhaiya Munjaji Dalvi using only HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. The site should feel handcrafted, modern, responsive, and distinct from common template-based portfolios.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Current State[m
[32m+[m[32mThe portfolio is already scaffolded and working as a single-page site with these sections:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Hero[m
[32m+[m[32m- About Me[m
[32m+[m[32m- Skills[m
[32m+[m[32m- Projects[m
[32m+[m[32m- Education[m
[32m+[m[32m- Achievements[m
[32m+[m[32m- Certificates[m
[32m+[m[32m- Contact[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe current implementation includes:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Custom navigation bar with smooth scrolling[m
[32m+[m[32m- Typing effect in the hero section[m
[32m+[m[32m- Scroll reveal animations[m
[32m+[m[32m- Animated skill bars[m
[32m+[m[32m- Mailto-based enquiry form[m
[32m+[m[32m- GitHub-backed project section[m
[32m+[m[32m- Certificates section linked to local PDF files[m
[32m+[m[32m- Profile image using `picture.png`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Files In Use[m
[32m+[m[32m- `index.html`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `styles.css`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `main.js`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `README.md`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `picture.png`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `Kanhaiya's Resume-hackerresume.pdf`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `certificates/`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Real Content Already Integrated[m
[32m+[m[32mThe projects section now uses actual GitHub repositories from `https://github.com/kanha9657`:[m
[32m+[m[32m- `Nirbhaya`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `exam_cheating_detection_software`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `public-complaint-portal`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `hospital-management-system`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `AI-Crop-Disease-Detection-System`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe profile picture is linked from `picture.png` in the portfolio root.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Working Features[m
[32m+[m[32m- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile[m
[32m+[m[32m- Reveal animations on scroll[m
[32m+[m[32m- Hero typing animation[m
[32m+[m[32m- Project cards generated dynamically from JavaScript[m
[32m+[m[32m- Certificate cards generated dynamically from JavaScript[m
[32m+[m[32m- Direct email enquiry form using `mailto:`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Known Gaps / Remaining Work[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Replace placeholder contact details:[m
[32m+[m[32m   - `your.email@example.com`[m
[32m+[m[32m   - GitHub/LinkedIn footer links[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Replace any remaining placeholder project metadata if you want more accurate descriptions, technologies, or screenshots.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Add real project thumbnails or screenshots for a stronger visual finish.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Optionally create an `assets/` folder for optimized images and icons.[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Optionally improve contact handling with a real form backend or service if you want submissions instead of mail client opening.[m
[32m+[m[32m6. Optionally add project filtering or repository metadata fetching if you want live GitHub integration later.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Risks / Notes[m
[32m+[m[32m- The enquiry form opens the user’s default mail client rather than sending in the background.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Project cards currently use curated repository information and generic visual placeholders instead of actual screenshots.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The GitHub links are hardcoded, so changes in repo names would need a manual update.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Recommended Next Steps[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Provide your final email address so the contact form can be updated.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Provide project screenshots or let me add polished placeholder artwork.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Decide whether you want a live form service instead of `mailto:`.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. If needed, I can now refine the spacing, typography, and project presentation based on your feedback.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Continuation Plan[m
[32m+[m[32mIf we continue from here, the best order is:[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Finalize contact and footer links.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Add or refine project visuals.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Polish mobile spacing and section balance.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Do a final cleanup pass and preview review.[m
