[32m+[m[32mQuick preview[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Place these files in your `portfolio/` folder.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Make sure your certificates and resume PDFs are in `portfolio/certificates/` and `portfolio/` respectively (the code references these filenames):[m
[32m+[m[32m   - `Kanhaiya's Resume-hackerresume.pdf`[m
