[32m+[m[32m   - `certificates/java_basic certificate.pdf`[m
[32m+[m[32m   - `certificates/software_engineer_intern certificate.pdf`[m
[32m+[m[32m   - `certificates/certificateJS.pdf`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Start a quick local server and open the site:[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m# from the portfolio folder[m
[32m+[m[32mpython3 -m http.server 8000[m
[32m+[m[32m# then open http://localhost:8000 in your browser[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCustomization notes[m
[32m+[m[32m- Replace `your.email@example.com` in `index.html` with your email.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Replace project placeholders in `main.js` (the `PROJECTS` array) with real titles, descriptions, links and thumbnails.[m
[32m+[m[32m- To add/remove certificates, update the `CERTIFICATES` array in `main.js` with exact filenames.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The design uses the Inter font. Swap or provide local fonts by editing the `<link>` in `index.html`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAccessibility[m
[32m+[m[32m- Keyboard skip link, meaningful landmarks and focus-friendly controls included.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Forms use mailto fallback; add a form service if you want serverless form submissions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mNext steps[m
[32m+[m[32m- If you want, I can add placeholder images in `assets/`, integrate project screenshots, or commit these files to your repo.[m
